WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:23.630
Escape!!

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:27.480
A missile?

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:30.580
Gozaburo wasn't bluffing!

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:33.640
Why is it aimed at us?

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:36.200
I don't have time to explain.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:37.850
Go to the arcade.

00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:41.150
It's the only exit to the real world.

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:43.220
Can we trust him?

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:44.150
Brother?

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:46.890
Dammit, Noa...

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:50.250
I don't want to die as a monkey!

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:52.900
I trust Noa.

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:54.900
You're right.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:02:00.280
Noa!  If you're lying, I'll make you pay!

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:06.900
Is Mokuba okay?

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.510
Yes.  Don't worry.

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:11.220
Noa!  What did you do?

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:13.510
Did you change the missile's trajectory?

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.530
Yes I did, Father.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:21.020
Sorry, but I'm in complete control of the virtual system.

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:26.020
You can no longer use the network to control it.

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:27.920
What?

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:30.770
You're betraying me?

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:35.530
You're using a missile to destroy your own father?

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:38.540
I'm sorry, Father.

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:43.520
Wise decision.  You're a slightly better person than I thought.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.780
Seto, hurry up!  There's no time!

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.920
Ridiculous!

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:53.780
Seto!  I'll steal your body and return to the real world!

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:56.140
Don't get ahead of yourself, Gozaburo!

00:02:57.560 --> 00:03:03.060
A duelist can't resign in the middle of a duel!

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:04.760
Noa, how much time's left?

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:07.770
8 minutes and 40 seconds.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.120
That's plenty.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.570
I'm continuing the duel, Gozaburo.

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:15.390
I'll give you my body if you win.

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:17.120
Me or you.

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:22.480
This is a death game where only the winner gets to escape this world.

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:28.920
Don't forget what you said.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.780
I'm the one who'll return to the real world.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:33.620
Here I go!

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:35.730
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.900
Kneel before Exodia, Seto!

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.000
Exodia Crush!

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:45.480
I won't let you!

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:48.660
I activate my set card, Negate Attack!

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:51.310
Exodia Necross's attack is negated!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.440
Just as I thought.

00:03:55.440 --> 00:04:00.950
It can't be destroyed, but spells and traps still work on it.

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:05.360
You don't know when to give up, Seto.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.720
But whatever.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:11.910
No matter how hard you try, you can't surpass me.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.310
Don't underestimate me, Gozaburo.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.060
Exodia isn't entirely invincible.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:19.860
I found a way to defeat it!

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:20.640
What?

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:33.080
They're after us again!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:33.820
Damn!

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.820
Leave them to us!  Go!

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.020
I'm not leaving without you!

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:40.370
Don't be silly!

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:43.030
Anzu!  Take Shizuka and go!

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:44.170
O-Okay.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:45.620
But don't do anything crazy.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:46.530
Brother!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.940
Don't worry!  "I'll be back!"

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:51.540
Leave 'em to me!

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:53.420
You're coming too!

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:54.850
You'll get in their way!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:58.410
My turn.  I draw.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.790
I activate the spell card, Shrink!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:06.150
Exodia Necross's attack points are halved!

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:14.150
Then I tribute Vorse Raider to summon Luster Dragon #2!

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:17.550
Go, Luster Dragon #2!

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.510
Attack Exodia!

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:31.170
Exodia Necross is an ultimate monster that may be stronger than a God.

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:32.910
But it has a weakness.

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:35.400
Interesting.  I'm listening.

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:42.360
Since Exodia Necross is offensive-minded, it always remains in attack position.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:51.400
So if I use a monster with higher attack points to attack it, you'll take damage.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.650
So what?

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:59.740
Exodia Necross may be immortal, but you're not.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.650
Then try to defeat me!

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:07.250
Due to the last battle, Exodia Necross gains attack points.

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:10.940
My turn.  I draw.

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:14.400
Go!  Exodia Crush!

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:22.580
How's that?

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:25.830
Exodia gains attack points again.

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:39.010
That dance battle game is the exit.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:40.970
Shizuka, hurry!

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:41.510
Okay!

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:58.170
Where am I?

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:01.640
We're inside the moving fortress.

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:05.950
We're back to the real world!

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:08.050
Hey!  Look at me!

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:10.070
Am I still a monkey?

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:11.570
You're fine.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:13.620
You're a human, Honda.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.180
Screech!  Hooray!

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.180
You don't look so different.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:22.490
Anzu!

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:26.720
Mokuba!

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:29.160
Good.  Jonouchi is next.

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:42.270
Get on the dance battle game!

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.470
Over there!

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.480
Otogi and Jonouchi, hurry!

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.850
Yugi!  Hurry up!

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:59.080
Hurry, Yugi!

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:02.130
Yugi.  I have a favor to ask.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:12.130
I'm back in the real world.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:13.640
Brother!

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:15.640
Shizuka!

00:08:16.110 --> 00:08:17.800
Thank goodness!  You okay?

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:18.630
Yeah.

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:22.920
Missile launch in 6 minutes and 18 seconds.

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:28.700
Seto is dueling our father in a dome on top of Kaiba Corporation.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:34.520
What?  Kaiba is dueling when a missile is about to hit us?

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:35.260
What an idiot!

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:39.640
Seto won't leave until he finishes his duel.

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:40.760
Kaiba...

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:44.770
I'll create a new exit at Kaiba Corporation.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.000
Yugi, I'm counting on you to get Seto.

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:49.770
Okay!

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:52.140
Yugi!  I'll come with you!

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:54.300
No, I'm fine by myself.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:57.180
You need to get ready to leave!

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.360
Yugi...

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:02.920
Okay.  But promise to come back, Yugi!

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:06.760
We still need to duel each other.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:08.680
Yes, definitely.

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.760
I promise to come back with Kaiba!

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:12.940
Yugi, there's no time.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.500
I'll create a path to Kaiba Corporation.

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:19.330
Let's go, Dark Magician!

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.740
Why, Noa?

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.570
Why are you helping Kaiba?

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:27.970
You hated him so much.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:35.850
This body...  Mokuba's body is asking me to save his brother.

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:41.200
Umm...  Sorry I didn't trust you.

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:42.750
It's only natural.

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:46.320
Missile launch in 3 minutes and 50 seconds.

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:48.650
We don't have time.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:52.370
Go to the Battle Ship and get ready to leave!

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.610
All right!  Let's go, Shizuka!

00:09:56.600 --> 00:10:00.910
Noa, you're the only one who can save Yugi and Kaiba.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:02.280
I'm counting on you.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:03.110
Right.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.570
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:09.520
I activate the spell card, Pot of Greed!

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:12.130
I draw two cards from my deck!

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:14.220
I set a monster in defense!

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:17.490
And I set a card.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.490
I end my turn.

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:25.280
Exodia has 4800 attack points.

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:30.530
If you can summon a monster that's stronger, go ahead and try!

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:36.600
Gozaburo, you're a fake duelist.

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:42.220
I'll show you how foolish it is to rely on just one powerful monster!

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:52.780
Kaiba!

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:14.680
My turn.  I draw.

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:17.370
Exodia Crush!

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:27.300
How's that?  It now has 5800 attack points.

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:33.110
Missile launch in 1 minute.

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:36.840
Hurry, Yugi!

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:44.850
My turn!

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:45.850
I draw!

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:48.350
Good!

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:51.150
The spell card, Monster Reborn!

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:53.980
Ancient Lamp resurrects from the graveyard!

00:11:55.250 --> 00:12:01.660
Ancient Lamp's effect lets me Special Summon La Jinn the Mystical Genie of the Lamp!

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:08.020
I've been fighting Exodia's ghost so far.

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:11.540
There's no point fighting a ghost!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.920
I'll destroy its soul instead!

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:16.650
I activate Soul Demolition!

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.650
What?  No!

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:29.660
Soul Demolition lets me banish monsters from your graveyard by paying 500 life points per card.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:30.990
Oh no!

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:38.230
I only have Luster Dragon #2, Vorse Raider and Spirit Ryu in my graveyard.

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:44.220
But there are five cards in your graveyard, Gozaburo!

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:49.640
You punk!

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:53.760
First, Left Leg of the Forbidden One!

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:58.460
Next, Right Leg of the Forbidden One!

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:02.360
Left Arm of the Forbidden One!

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:05.060
Right Arm of the Forbidden One!

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.100
And this will end you!

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.820
Exodia the Forbidden One!

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:29.320
I tribute La Jinn the Mystical Genie of the Lamp and Ancient Lamp.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:33.960
Come out, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:46.280
Checkmate, Gozaburo.

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:50.840
Take this!  Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.440
Missile launch in 10 seconds.

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.660
Counting down.

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:12.170
8... 7... 6...

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:14.240
I lost?

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:15.510
Impossible!

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:21.170
I used tons of duel data to create the perfect strategy!

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:26.410
You can't use data to evaluate me.

00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:28.910
How dare you!  Unforgivable!

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:33.800
I won't let you leave, Seto!

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:36.260
Have you gone mad, Gozaburo?

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.130
Yugi!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.690
3... 2... 1...

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.420
Ignition.

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:05.720
Launching missile.

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.760
The missile is on its way!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.040
There's no place to run.

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:33.170
Jump!

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:34.340
But...

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:35.940
Kaiba!  Let's go!

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:37.600
What?

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:46.920
Missile approaching.

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:53.580
Is this the real world?

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.800
We're back!

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:57.400
Mokuba!

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:07.440
I'm sorry, Mokuba.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.380
I'll give your body back.

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:11.810
Noa, what are you going to do?

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:15.720
I'm going back to my father.

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:17.580
But...!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:23.560
It was only for a short time, but I was happy to have a real body.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:25.740
Don't go, Noa!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:29.380
I remember what it's like to be human again.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:32.660
Thanks to you, Mokuba.  Thank you.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:33.580
Noa...

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:37.240
I'm a human.  Not a machine.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.550
Noa!

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:41.970
Noa!

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:44.950
Mokuba!  Open your eyes!

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:47.400
Wake up!

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:51.750
Mokuba...

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:54.250
Big brother!  Noa is...

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:02.810
I won't let you get away, Seto!

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:04.860
It's no use, Father!

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:06.330
Noa!

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.860
I've erased the exit.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:13.370
So you can't escape.

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:16.430
Missile approaching.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:24.080
Noa returned to the virtual world!

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:27.330
He said he couldn't abandon Gozaburo!

00:17:31.770 --> 00:17:34.660
What's taking Yugi so long?

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:36.570
If they don't hurry, the missile will...

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:37.760
Hurry, Yugi!

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:40.770
Missile approaching.

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:43.570
Hurry up.

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:46.570
Or everyone will die.

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:51.080
What's the meaning of this?

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:54.980
Open the exit!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.660
I now understand.

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:00.520
Seto has Mokuba.

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:03.100
Yugi has many friends.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:06.000
I thought I was alone.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:07.430
But I was wrong.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:11.060
I don't have time for this!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:13.300
I have you, Father.

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:16.660
Silence!  Let me out now!

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:19.320
You're my only family.

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:23.260
We're brothers after all.

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:26.660
Father, let's end this.

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.810
I'll be with you forever.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:32.710
What are you doing, Noa!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:37.110
Let me go!  I still have things to do!

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:41.810
We're already dead, Father.

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:44.330
Let me go!

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:52.270
Here they come!

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:53.140
Yugi!

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:56.140
Hurry!  Over here!

00:18:56.140 --> 00:19:00.650
Hurry!  Yugi!  C'mon!

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:01.730
Hurry!

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:02.580
Grab my arm!

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:03.150
Hurry!

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:15.000
Yugi!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.190
Jonouchi!

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:32.610
No!  I don't want to die!

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:43.820
Goodbye, Mokuba.

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:45.620
Noa.

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:57.570
Mr. Seto!  The ship can't tolerate these shockwaves!

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:00.570
Give me the controls!

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:08.080
Seto!

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:15.240
Gozaburo!  I won't lose to you!

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:48.190
I feel bad for Noa.

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:52.090
He only wanted his father to love him.

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:55.260
Noa was a victim.

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:58.200
Noa...

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:07.810
Both Gozaburo and Noa are fools.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:12.120
We were sidetracked, but our battle now begins.

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:15.450
The final battlefield, Alcatraz, awaits us.

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:19.440
Full speed ahead to Alcatraz!

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:20.090
Yes, sir!

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:36.700
I'm a human.  Not a machine.

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:43.370
Everyone, remember?

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:48.520
We were headed to the final stage of Battle City.

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:51.900
It felt like we were in the virtual world for a long time.

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:54.950
But little time has actually passed.

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:59.220
The Battle Ship lands on Alcatraz, the island for the finals.

00:21:59.220 --> 00:22:03.200
A giant tower stands within a destroyed building.

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:04.970
That's the venue for the finals?

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:07.800
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Venue for the Finals  Alcatraz

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:09.320
Duel, standby!

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:20.890
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:20.890 --> 00:22:29.840
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.170 --> 00:22:34.810
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:34.810 --> 00:22:38.780
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:46.750
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:50.320
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:50.320 --> 00:22:55.090
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.090 --> 00:23:05.200
And walk it without stopping

00:23:05.200 --> 00:23:12.810
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:21.780
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:21.780 --> 00:23:29.760
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:39.600
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
